{"root":{"data":{"id":"dl28u5ia5r40","created":1788089528897,"text":"Color OS16系统"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2ptjgyo9s0","created":1788137439797,"text":"系统定义","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2ptw4otoo0","created":1788137467353,"text":"操作系统本质是硬件 和 应用程序（App）中间的一层管理者。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2pw0ci7h40","created":1788137633261,"text":"引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2pw4rzbq00","created":1788137642904,"text":"极光引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2px44bzpk0","created":1788137719838,"text":"转场动画连贯 “从哪来回哪去”，点击响应、滑动帧率稳定性提升；\n不只系统 UI，第三方 App 也接入这套渲染调度。","layout_left_offset":{"x":-57.99999956786644,"y":-9.999999925494194}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2pwh8mlls0","created":1788137670032,"text":"潮汐引擎"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2pxdxynrk0","created":1788137741221,"text":"软件和手机 SoC 芯片深度协同，毫秒级动态升降算力，动画线程优先调度。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2q08l2o680","created":1788137964650,"text":"繁星编译器","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2q0hrmla00","created":1788137984637,"text":"OPPO全新自研编译器通过业界独创跨级融合编译，大幅提升了编译语言的执行效率，\n助力系统响应更迅速、更流畅，让全价位机型都有顶级的流畅体验。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2q3c08xdc0","created":1788138207190,"text":"Ai服务"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2q4saio280","created":1788138321004,"text":"小布助手"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2q4vfd6540","created":1788138327827,"text":"小布助手使用全新唤醒方式及界面，提供更多的功能，从仅可以“听”和“说”的语音助手升级为能听得清、看得懂、还能帮你做事情的超级小布助理。开启小布后，可以通过语音查询天气、点外卖、发短信、打电话、定闹钟等。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2q6mhxl0g0","created":1788138465120,"text":"小布记忆"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2q70usujk0","created":1788138496373,"text":"管理各个平台收藏种草的内容"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2q7mzw4o80","created":1788138544570,"text":"同款大师参数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2q7sekpzk0","created":1788138556342,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2q3sz4hw00","created":1788138244127,"text":"跨端互联"},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}